{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04046","headline":"春晚送瑕丘田少府还任因寄洛中镜上人 · 苏頲","name":"春晚送瑕丘田少府还任因寄洛中镜上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道还沂上，因声寄洛滨。\n别时花欲尽，归处酒应春。\n聚散同行客，悲欢属故人。\n少年追乐地，遥赠一沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}